{"name":"Coppersmith","hex":"#d98a3f","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Coppersmith","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A surname originating as an occupation."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Coppersmith"}],"entries":[{"title":"Coppersmith","blocks":[{"text":"A coppersmith, also known as a brazier, is a person who makes artifacts from copper and brass. Brass is an alloy of copper and zinc. The term \"redsmith\" is used for a tinsmith that uses tinsmithing tools and techniques to make copper items."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/88/0_Le_dinandier_Guy_Clabots_-_Leffe_%281%29.JPG/330px-0_Le_dinandier_Guy_Clabots_-_Leffe_%281%29.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Coppersmith"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f0/Kupferschmiede_-_Coppersmithy_-_Museumsdorf_Cloppenburg_-_Open_air_museum_Cloppenburg.jpg/500px-Kupferschmiede_-_Coppersmithy_-_Museumsdorf_Cloppenburg_-_Open_air_museum_Cloppenburg.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f0/Kupferschmiede_-_Coppersmithy_-_Museumsdorf_Cloppenburg_-_Open_air_museum_Cloppenburg.jpg/1280px-Kupferschmiede_-_Coppersmithy_-_Museumsdorf_Cloppenburg_-_Open_air_museum_Cloppenburg.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f0/Kupferschmiede_-_Coppersmithy_-_Museumsdorf_Cloppenburg_-_Open_air_museum_Cloppenburg.jpg/500px-Kupferschmiede_-_Coppersmithy_-_Museumsdorf_Cloppenburg_-_Open_air_museum_Cloppenburg.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"\nWorkshop of a coppersmith in Cloppenburg, Germany; the oldest units are from the period around 1850","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AKupferschmiede_-